        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BOUNCE ADVENTURE is a vibrant 2D pixel-style action platform game  where you control a lively, elastic ball and dive into the whimsical world of Toy City. Navigate through finely crafted levels, dodge deadly traps, solve clever puzzles, and take on a fast-paced, fun-filled adventure packed with challenges!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >                                                            <strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genre: 2D Side-Scrolling Action / Platformer / Pixel Art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standalone levels and endless challenge modes — enjoy nonstop bouncing fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear level faster, collect more rings — earn greater achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic traps and smart enemies — test both your reflexes and strategic thinking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight physics and responsive controls — delivering a smooth and satisfying bouncing experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planned Features: Level editor &amp; online multiplayer — create your own maps, invite friends to take on your challenges, and explore a community-driven world of creativity.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developer: Solo indie developer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to jump into this bouncy world? Let's bounce, adventurer!</p>",
